      <span class="section-tag">Built for Australians</span>
      <h2>Your money is more complex than most apps account for.</h2>
      <p>Generic budgeting apps track your spending. Robo-advisors manage your portfolio. Banks offer basic snapshots. None of them bring it all together — with your values built in.</p>
      <ul class="sectors-list">
        <li>Super contributions — know exactly where you stand against your concessional cap before EOFY</li>
        <li>HECS/HELP debt — understand the real drag on your income and how to clear it faster</li>
        <li>Portfolio values screening — ESG, faith-based, or custom criteria, built in not bolted on</li>
        <li>Debt optimisation — see the true cost of every liability and the fastest path out</li>
        <li>Cashflow clarity — know what you actually have, not just what your bank balance says</li>
        <li>Personalised action plan — specific next steps, not generic advice</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sectors-note">One platform. Every piece of your financial life. Scored, screened, and actioned.</p>
